WEBVTT

00:03.520 --> 00:08.740
W-Woah, h-hold on, Lady Priscilla...

00:08.740 --> 00:10.740
B-Bweheheh...

00:11.140 --> 00:13.160
If I am to dance with the diva,

00:13.160 --> 00:16.540
it is only natural that I wear a dress
befitting the occasion!

00:16.540 --> 00:19.040
How grateful I am, how grateful I am...

00:19.040 --> 00:20.530
Wait, no!

00:21.040 --> 00:25.420
You're going into a decisive battle,
yet I'm the only one going with you?

00:25.800 --> 00:28.050
At the very least,
you could bring Sir Al...

00:28.050 --> 00:30.300
Al is nothing more than a jester.

00:30.300 --> 00:33.100
What could possibly be lacking
when I am present?

00:33.100 --> 00:38.350
Right! Those massive tits pretty much
make you a goddess, Lady Priscilla!

00:38.350 --> 00:40.100
Oh, what's this?

00:41.020 --> 00:44.230
I reckon I've stumbled
into quite the scene!

00:45.320 --> 00:46.590
She-fox.

00:46.590 --> 00:51.110
Hey now, ain't it a bit rude to be calling
someone that the moment she shows up?

00:51.740 --> 00:55.490
Thing is, after everyone's left,
this place's defenses will be...

00:55.490 --> 00:58.250
Now that we've diverted resources
to the control gates,

00:58.250 --> 01:02.880
those greedy louts will undoubtedly aim
for our undefended base.

01:03.450 --> 01:05.300
Use Al as you please.

01:05.300 --> 01:07.460
Glad you're quick on the uptake.

01:07.460 --> 01:09.300
Oh, I see!

01:09.300 --> 01:12.150
So you trust Sir Al so much that—

01:13.800 --> 01:17.020
Whether I trust that fool is
a completely different matter!

01:17.640 --> 01:19.810
He tends to keep quiet
about many things...

01:19.810 --> 01:22.560
However, when it comes
to matters of secrecy,

01:22.560 --> 01:25.170
you are no better, are you,

01:25.980 --> 01:27.530
she-fox?

01:27.530 --> 01:29.820
Oh? I got no clue
what you're talkin' about.

01:30.260 --> 01:32.280
If you wish to feign ignorance, so be it.

01:32.280 --> 01:38.790
Stew that malformed guilt
toward your knight for all I care.

01:39.220 --> 01:41.540
Hey, no need to be so nasty.

01:41.540 --> 01:43.500
So, do you have a plan?

01:44.770 --> 01:47.500
Why would I resort to petty tricks?

01:47.500 --> 01:51.480
I shall take the diva with me
and confront them directly

03:33.000 --> 03:35.320
Honestly, I should probably stop you,

03:35.320 --> 03:38.410
but I do want to pinpoint
where Book of Wisdom is,

03:38.410 --> 03:40.870
since the Witch Cult is after it.

03:40.870 --> 03:43.750
You sure drew
the short end of the stick, Otto.

03:44.870 --> 03:46.620
Sheesh...

03:48.830 --> 03:49.830
Isn't that...

03:49.830 --> 03:51.590
Lady Felt?!

03:51.910 --> 03:54.210
Welcome, mister...

03:55.090 --> 03:57.590
Welcome to the feeding grounds...

03:57.590 --> 04:03.750
of the Witch Cult's Archbishop of Greed,
Lye Batenkaitos!

04:14.860 --> 04:16.780
That aberration!

04:16.780 --> 04:18.150
So that is...

04:18.150 --> 04:20.510
the Archbishop of Lust!

04:23.760 --> 04:25.450
They're here.

04:27.500 --> 04:28.710
Sir Garfiel...

04:30.120 --> 04:34.000
That swordswoman is none other
than my wife,

04:34.440 --> 04:37.470
the previous Sword Saint, Theresia.

04:38.590 --> 04:40.840
F-From what I've heard,

04:40.840 --> 04:44.930
didn't the previous Sword Saint
get done in by the White Whale...?

04:44.930 --> 04:47.480
I have already avenged her death.

04:47.480 --> 04:48.810
It was supposed to be over.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.650
However...

04:51.520 --> 04:54.940
Our enemies have desecrated
my wife's corpse,

04:54.940 --> 04:56.980
violated her soul,

04:56.980 --> 05:01.570
and forced her to turn her sword
on those she swore to protect.

05:01.570 --> 05:04.830
They shall pay for this transgression!

05:12.120 --> 05:16.130
I-I'm...
Olegren sittin' by the campfire...

05:16.130 --> 05:19.550
I'll make 'em regret comin' out here!

05:31.850 --> 05:33.350
Take this!

05:34.860 --> 05:35.730
Wha—?!

05:37.940 --> 05:39.570
I'm just gettin' started!

06:02.010 --> 06:03.410
Theresia...

06:11.140 --> 06:12.180
Diva.

06:12.180 --> 06:15.770
Are you concerned
about the Songstress Fanatic?

06:16.400 --> 06:18.020
Y-Yes...

06:18.520 --> 06:21.240
About Kiritaka-san, I...

06:22.570 --> 06:26.950
Considering the enemy's demands,
it is unlikely that they would kill him.

06:26.950 --> 06:28.870
What?! Really?!

06:28.870 --> 06:33.000
Only the Council of Ten knows
where the Witch's bones are.

06:33.000 --> 06:34.750
They need him alive.

06:34.750 --> 06:39.170
Then why are they killing
council members left and right?!

06:39.170 --> 06:40.590
It doesn't make sense!

06:40.590 --> 06:44.970
Because it was not the cultists' doing.

06:45.380 --> 06:49.990
Someone who seeks to thwart
the Witch Cult's plans got to them first.

06:50.600 --> 06:51.680
Th-Then...

06:51.680 --> 06:54.810
Lady Priscilla,
do any suspects come to mind—

07:03.940 --> 07:08.030
Sorry for making you come all this way!

07:11.700 --> 07:12.910
Thank you.

07:17.210 --> 07:18.330
Subaru!

07:18.330 --> 07:20.960
Absolutely beautiful! EMT!

07:20.960 --> 07:23.130
Well, anyway...

07:23.130 --> 07:25.420
Looks like we just barely made it.

07:25.850 --> 07:29.050
So you are him,
the man this insolent whore dallied with.

07:29.050 --> 07:31.180
Absolutely incomprehensible.

07:31.180 --> 07:33.060
If it was that redhead next to you,

07:33.060 --> 07:36.560
it would've made a little more sense,
but to choose you over me?

07:36.560 --> 07:40.020
Are her eyeballs made
of decorative glass beads?

07:40.020 --> 07:42.400
At least call them jewels!

07:42.400 --> 07:46.240
Oh, and I'm obviously nothing
compared to this guy, so stop that!

07:46.240 --> 07:48.490
Sword Saint, was it?

07:48.490 --> 07:50.320
I've heard the term before.

07:50.320 --> 07:53.620
Isn't that some brainless fool
who can do nothing but swing a sword?

07:54.030 --> 07:56.500
A fitting way to put it.
However...

07:56.500 --> 07:59.330
It's still unclear whether
I'm capable of fulfilling that role.

07:59.330 --> 08:02.800
This Dragon Sword has been passed down
from the founders of the Astrea family.

08:03.240 --> 08:05.510
It's the strongest sword in the world.

08:06.010 --> 08:08.220
However, it has a single flaw.

08:09.430 --> 08:14.950
This sword cannot be unsheathed
unless in the presence of a worthy foe.

08:15.880 --> 08:17.260
In other words...

08:19.100 --> 08:23.730
Apparently, this sword doesn't think
you're a fitting opponent.

08:24.820 --> 08:26.610
Now listen here...!

08:26.610 --> 08:30.280
What use is a Sword Saint
who can't even draw his sword?!

08:30.280 --> 08:33.660
Stop patronizing me, small fry!

08:33.660 --> 08:34.910
This way, Subaru!

08:37.080 --> 08:41.750
Don't move! Try anything funny
and their lives are forfeit!

08:43.210 --> 08:47.550
Man, this goes way beyond
having nerves of steel.

08:48.010 --> 08:50.010
Who are these ladies, anyway?

08:50.010 --> 08:53.640
They are all my precious wives.

08:53.640 --> 08:59.440
If you resist, then I will have no choice
but to kill the women I love!

08:59.440 --> 09:03.810
How cruel and monstrous must you be
to force me to commit such an atrocity!

09:03.810 --> 09:07.320
Crap, we can't even talk to him...

09:07.770 --> 09:10.740
Though they may die by my hand,

09:10.740 --> 09:12.950
it was you who forced me to act!

09:13.400 --> 09:17.330
You are nothing more than murderers,
using me for your dirty work!

09:17.330 --> 09:19.870
- How dare you threaten my wives!
- Can you not...

09:20.830 --> 09:22.120
...forget about me?!

09:25.840 --> 09:27.210
You let your guard down.

09:27.990 --> 09:29.170
You lose.

09:29.670 --> 09:31.680
Now listen here...

09:31.680 --> 09:35.640
I was just about
to corner those interlopers.

09:35.640 --> 09:39.430
This was supposed to be the moment
I prove myself to my wives!

09:39.430 --> 09:41.230
Release everyone this instant!

09:41.230 --> 09:42.440
No, Emilia!

09:42.440 --> 09:44.310
That's not enough to stop him!

09:44.310 --> 09:45.950
Goodness...

09:48.640 --> 09:51.720
It seems I was right
not to take you as my wife.

09:55.160 --> 09:59.040
You're violent, and you don't know
how to support a man.

09:59.040 --> 10:02.040
Whether you're pure of body
and heart no longer matters.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.830
You are an impure wench!

10:03.830 --> 10:06.840
A wretch toying with my pure heart!

10:06.840 --> 10:08.210
Get your stupid hands off her!

10:08.210 --> 10:09.550
Stupid...?

10:09.550 --> 10:11.260
You are the stupid one here.

10:11.260 --> 10:13.430
Can't you see what's going on around you?

10:13.430 --> 10:16.550
Or perhaps... Have you simply given up
the effort to understand?

10:17.180 --> 10:18.220
Very well.

10:18.810 --> 10:20.850
Please release Lady Emilia.

10:20.850 --> 10:22.310
We'll hear your demands.

10:22.850 --> 10:24.690
Yes, yes, that's it!

10:24.690 --> 10:27.440
That is how you show humility and grace!

10:28.000 --> 10:30.650
Now, throw aside that sword
and come over here.

10:44.470 --> 10:45.830
That's far enough.

10:46.500 --> 10:50.500
You will stand there
and endure one attack.

10:50.500 --> 10:52.720
You may not dodge or block.

10:52.720 --> 10:57.220
After that, I will consider
our quarrel resolved.

10:57.220 --> 10:59.640
Very well, I accept.

10:59.640 --> 11:00.600
Reinhard!

11:00.600 --> 11:03.850
You've got a plan, right?
I'm trusting you here!

11:04.310 --> 11:06.060
We made a promise, Subaru.

11:06.060 --> 11:09.230
You'll take care of what I cannot, right?

11:10.150 --> 11:11.900
A splendid show of resolve.

11:11.900 --> 11:14.400
It's time I show you
the respect you deserve.

11:24.250 --> 11:28.670
No matter what kind of life we lead,
death comes all too quickly.

11:29.030 --> 11:31.340
Now, did you die content?

11:34.630 --> 11:39.090
Compared to how pure and dignified he was,
you're a rather sorry sight.

11:39.090 --> 11:41.430
Can you not see that I have a hostage?

11:41.430 --> 11:42.850
That's odd.

11:45.060 --> 11:49.940
As I recall, you said you'd release her.

12:10.520 --> 12:13.420
Lye Batenkaitos...

12:13.910 --> 12:19.260
Was the Archbishop of Gluttony
I encountered a different person?

12:19.260 --> 12:20.550
Oh? What's this?

12:20.550 --> 12:23.970
Ya know not only "us,"
but also "ourselves"?

12:23.970 --> 12:27.270
So, you're saying...
there are two Archbishops of Gluttony?

12:27.270 --> 12:30.810
Or rather, at least two.

12:30.810 --> 12:34.440
Oooh... you're not too far off, mister.

12:34.440 --> 12:36.030
On a closer look,

12:36.030 --> 12:41.160
you're the appetizer
we never got to savor.

12:42.230 --> 12:43.370
Hey!

12:43.790 --> 12:46.370
This ain't the time to be chitchattin'!

12:46.370 --> 12:48.120
A-Are we really gonna take him on?!

12:48.120 --> 12:50.370
We're dealin' with an Archbishop here!

12:50.370 --> 12:53.500
You plannin' to die here
before you see your daughter?!

12:53.500 --> 12:57.170
Oh, don't be so gloomy.

12:57.170 --> 13:01.800
Every encounter adds to the spice of life!

13:01.800 --> 13:04.300
They may call us Gluttony,

13:04.300 --> 13:06.100
- but even we know the importance
- You were...

13:06.100 --> 13:08.090
- of good prep work!
- ...from the White Dragon Scale,

13:08.090 --> 13:09.230
- of good prep work!
- Mr. Kiritaka's personal guard, yes?

13:09.730 --> 13:11.980
And you're...
Lady Emilia's domestic adviser.

13:11.980 --> 13:13.690
Seems we're both out of luck.

13:13.690 --> 13:14.360
Yes.

13:14.900 --> 13:16.860
A head-on confrontation...

13:16.860 --> 13:19.320
between a makeshift team
and the enemy's powerhouse.

13:19.740 --> 13:21.240
This is downright ridiculous.

13:21.240 --> 13:22.990
I don't wanna hear that from you!

13:22.990 --> 13:25.950
Now now, don't fight!

13:25.950 --> 13:30.910
If anything,
why not help us in our search?

13:30.910 --> 13:33.630
There's only one thing we wanna know...

13:33.630 --> 13:38.460
The whereabouts of that hero
who made that broadcast!

13:38.460 --> 13:44.850
The precious, beloved hero
was supposed to come and judge us!

13:45.220 --> 13:47.890
Oh how my little heart yearns for it!

13:47.890 --> 13:52.100
It pounds and pounds,
as if it's goin' to burst!

13:52.100 --> 13:55.810
If we have the same person in mind,
I was with him just recently.

13:56.230 --> 13:58.980
Ah! Ya know?! So you do know!

13:58.980 --> 14:01.820
You know where our hero is!

14:01.820 --> 14:05.070
Our precious, beloved hero!

14:06.780 --> 14:09.410
The ever-weak and fragile hero,

14:09.410 --> 14:12.370
who might fall apart
without someone to support him!

14:12.370 --> 14:14.120
Yes, him!

14:14.120 --> 14:17.130
Huh? Um, yes, I do...

14:18.460 --> 14:21.340
If you want, I could lead you to him.

14:21.340 --> 14:25.190
I do value my life, so if you could
at least guarantee my safety...

14:25.190 --> 14:26.600
You...

14:27.030 --> 14:28.810
You're a merchant, aren't you?

14:29.150 --> 14:29.770
Huh...?

14:29.770 --> 14:31.480
We knew it!

14:31.480 --> 14:33.230
You put a price on things,

14:33.230 --> 14:36.110
sell them to others,
and fatten your own pockets!

14:36.110 --> 14:39.780
You assign numbers to human worth,
desires, everything,

14:39.780 --> 14:40.940
EVERYTHING!

14:40.940 --> 14:42.240
A money-grubbing monster...

14:42.240 --> 14:44.610
- ...who would weigh and offer anything for coin!
- Th-There might be a few misconceptions here...

14:44.610 --> 14:46.240
Ya thought ya could trick us?!

14:46.240 --> 14:47.870
You can't trick us!

14:47.870 --> 14:51.620
Ain't no one's gonna listen
to the likes of you!

14:51.620 --> 14:52.870
Why the sudden...

14:52.870 --> 14:55.620
Hah! Must've dug up some crappy memories!

14:56.210 --> 14:59.840
In the end, this world is nothing
but an endless feast.

14:59.840 --> 15:00.750
Here he comes!

15:00.750 --> 15:03.010
Now, let us dig in!

15:03.010 --> 15:07.050
When negotiating with merchants,
you'd best listen until the end.

15:11.100 --> 15:13.560
Because they always have
something up their sleeve!

15:20.150 --> 15:21.820
Ah, we knew it!

15:22.290 --> 15:25.200
You really came to see "ourselves"!

15:25.780 --> 15:28.160
We're touched!

15:28.160 --> 15:31.160
So that's the Archbishop of Gluttony...

15:31.160 --> 15:32.340
Ricardo.

15:33.610 --> 15:35.790
We'll go all out from the start.

15:35.790 --> 15:36.870
Let's coordinate.

15:36.870 --> 15:38.380
Sure! Leave it to me!

15:43.130 --> 15:44.800
Alright, sure,

15:44.800 --> 15:47.220
very well, maybe so,

15:47.220 --> 15:49.050
that's right, splendid,

15:49.050 --> 15:51.260
that's right, and that's precisely why...

15:51.870 --> 15:54.730
We drink! We gorge!

15:55.140 --> 15:59.230
I am spirit knight Julius Juukulius,
and I will give it my all!

16:00.190 --> 16:02.610
Al Clauzeria!

16:04.520 --> 16:05.940
Truly...

16:05.940 --> 16:09.700
It's wonderful how true to form you are,
Lord Brother.

16:15.540 --> 16:16.660
Are you unharmed?

16:17.170 --> 16:19.580
Emilia-tan! You okay?!

16:19.580 --> 16:21.250
Yeah, fine and dandy.

16:21.250 --> 16:22.290
Thanks.

16:22.700 --> 16:25.760
I always believed you'd come for me.

16:25.760 --> 16:30.300
Me too, Emilia-tan. I believed in you
who believed I'd come for you.

16:30.890 --> 16:36.060
After all, if I'm going to marry someone,
it has to be someone I love!

16:36.060 --> 16:39.770
Right! Phew, that's a relief...

16:39.770 --> 16:42.770
By the way, uh,
about that someone you love...

16:42.770 --> 16:44.610
Subaru! Your foot!

16:44.610 --> 16:45.650
Oh, this?

16:46.060 --> 16:47.020
Are you okay?!

16:47.020 --> 16:49.990
Despite how it looks,
it's actually fine.

16:49.990 --> 16:53.080
More importantly, you okay, Reinhard?

16:53.870 --> 16:57.290
Oh no! Take off your clothes!
I'll get you patched up right away!

16:57.290 --> 16:59.290
Apologies for worrying you,

16:59.290 --> 17:00.670
but I'm okay.

17:01.120 --> 17:03.420
See? There's no wound.

17:04.750 --> 17:08.380
I figured you'd be able
to pull anything off, but...

17:08.380 --> 17:10.840
That was way too unexpected.

17:10.840 --> 17:13.100
I'm glad you believed in me.

17:13.100 --> 17:15.870
The Phoenix's Divine Blessing
can revive me from a single death,

17:15.870 --> 17:17.810
but I was actually dead
for a moment there.

17:17.810 --> 17:21.230
"Dead for a moment"? That's not something
you can just brush off, you dumbass!

17:21.640 --> 17:22.690
Apologies.

17:22.690 --> 17:25.150
I believed that was the optimal choice.

17:25.150 --> 17:28.360
Though, I'd rather not die a second time.

17:28.360 --> 17:30.990
Yeah, makes sense...

17:30.990 --> 17:32.490
By the way...

17:33.070 --> 17:37.160
From what we were talking about earlier,
these people are...

17:37.160 --> 17:38.040
Right.

17:38.620 --> 17:41.000
They're all Regulus' wives,

17:41.480 --> 17:44.880
though I really don't
want to accept it.

17:44.880 --> 17:48.580
Looking at the way he treats his wives,
they must be pretty unhappy.

17:48.580 --> 17:49.970
Now listen here.

17:49.970 --> 17:53.800
How could you be so cheerful
after treating me with such barbarity?

17:53.800 --> 17:57.180
And here I thought there was a limit
to how inhumane one could be!

17:57.180 --> 17:58.430
I see.

17:58.430 --> 18:01.060
As you said, he's quite an odd one.

18:01.060 --> 18:05.190
We're not getting anywhere unless
we figure out how his invincibility works—

18:08.190 --> 18:11.610
Subaru, I'll face him as we planned.

18:12.040 --> 18:14.250
You figure out
how to undo his invincibility!

18:15.070 --> 18:16.660
Alright, Emilia-tan!

18:17.690 --> 18:19.750
Hey, are you okay?

18:19.750 --> 18:21.580
You're not hurt, are you?

18:21.580 --> 18:22.910
I...

18:22.910 --> 18:24.750
We will stay here.

18:24.750 --> 18:25.830
Why?!

18:25.830 --> 18:27.090
Did you hurt your leg?!

18:27.090 --> 18:28.800
I can carry you on my back!

18:29.280 --> 18:31.760
Lord Husband has not given us
his permission.

18:33.220 --> 18:38.970
Acting without his permission
will incur his wrath.

18:39.390 --> 18:42.350
I get that you're afraid of Regulus!

18:42.350 --> 18:45.230
But this guy here
is the Sword Saint, Reinhard!

18:45.230 --> 18:47.110
He'll definitely beat Regulus!

18:47.110 --> 18:49.520
The result will be the same
no matter who it is.

18:50.070 --> 18:52.120
Who could possibly stand
against Lord Husband...

18:52.710 --> 18:55.280
Against Regulus Corneas?

18:56.950 --> 18:57.740
Subaru?!

18:59.330 --> 19:01.500
Reinhard! Change of plans!

19:03.910 --> 19:06.080
What in blazes is wrong with you?!

19:06.080 --> 19:07.040
Change of plans?

19:07.470 --> 19:09.130
Subaru,
what about the women inside?

19:09.130 --> 19:11.800
What the?! Where the heck
is your voice coming from?!

19:12.190 --> 19:14.300
This is the
Divine Protection of Telepathy.

19:14.300 --> 19:17.510
It allows my voice
to reach visible friends.

19:17.510 --> 19:20.100
You're getting less human
by the second, man!

19:20.100 --> 19:21.970
Anyway, change of plans!

19:21.970 --> 19:24.020
Time for Plan I!

19:25.890 --> 19:30.190
You may be absurdly powerful,

19:30.190 --> 19:31.610
but with a brain like that,

19:31.610 --> 19:34.190
it's nothing more than pearls
before swine!

19:34.580 --> 19:37.570
Indeed.
That's why, from here on...

19:38.280 --> 19:41.620
I'll have to take
a more roundabout approach!

19:42.370 --> 19:45.790
You just don't get it, do you?!

19:49.130 --> 19:51.670
Wait, Subaru! What are you planning?!

19:52.590 --> 19:54.800
Emilia-tan, you're so bold!

19:54.800 --> 19:58.180
I mean, this dress is cute,
but it's hard to move in.

19:58.180 --> 20:01.260
More importantly,
what did you ask Reinhard to do?

20:01.260 --> 20:04.310
He's carrying one of the plans
we went over before we got here.

20:04.310 --> 20:07.940
We've gotta figure out
how to break his invincibility,

20:08.390 --> 20:12.530
so we're testing every
possible solution one by one.

20:13.680 --> 20:15.320
Regulus is the one in the wrong here,

20:15.320 --> 20:17.900
so I'm not going to blame you girls
for anything.

20:17.900 --> 20:20.280
But let me say one thing!

20:20.280 --> 20:24.290
"So what?" If you don't say that,
nothing's gonna change!

20:24.290 --> 20:28.040
Keep your eyes closed,
and you won't see anything—

20:28.040 --> 20:30.960
not today, not tomorrow!

20:30.960 --> 20:34.210
Let's go, Subaru! We have to fight too!

21:05.160 --> 21:08.870
Can't chicken out now...

21:08.870 --> 21:13.670
The Chief, my bro Otto...
they're all waitin' for me!

21:15.460 --> 21:17.960
I've gotta fight...

21:17.960 --> 21:21.180
That's the only thing I'm good for!

21:21.180 --> 21:22.680
Sir Garfiel! Above you!

21:27.100 --> 21:30.100
Lust... No, it's somethin' else!

21:40.360 --> 21:43.290
Let's protect this city together!

21:44.930 --> 21:47.610
We'll take back our city!

21:49.000 --> 21:52.080
Alright! It's the decisive battle!
For justice!

21:55.210 --> 21:56.710
Just kidding!

22:00.050 --> 22:01.300
You're...!

22:02.100 --> 22:05.970
Tadah! Here I am!

22:05.970 --> 22:08.970
CITY IN CHAOS
Tadah! Here I am!

22:08.970 --> 22:09.980
CITY IN CHAOS
